=== Treasure Chests ===
{{Main|Treasure Chests}}
{{Item|Ruby}}, {{Item|Amber}}, {{Item|Sapphire}}, {{Item|Jade}}, {{Item|Amethyst}} and {{Item|Topaz}} '''Gemstones''' of Rough, {{Green|Flawed}} and {{Blue|Fine}} qualities can be found in [[Treasure Chests]]. The possible '''Gemstone''' types depend on the location of the [[Treasure Chest]].

=== Metal Detector ===
{{Item|Ruby}}, {{Item|Amber}}, {{Item|Sapphire}}, {{Item|Jade}}, {{Item|Amethyst}} and {{Item|Topaz}} '''Gemstones''' of Rough, {{Green|Flawed}} and {{Blue|Fine}} qualities can be found using a {{Item|Metal Detector}} in the {{Zone|Mines of Divan}}.

