=== Crystal Nucleus ===
The [[Crystal Nucleus]] drops 1 {{Blue|Fine}} '''Gemstone''' of each type when completed. It can also drop additional {{Green|Flawed}}, {{Blue|Fine}} or {{Purple|Flawless}} '''Gemstones''' of any kind.

=== Frozen Corpses ===
[[Frozen Corpses]] can be found in {{zone|Glacite Mineshafts}} and can be looted for a variety of rewards, including '''Gemstones'''.

=== Fossil Excavator ===
'''Gemstones''' can be found while excavating {{Item|Suspicious Scrap}}s in the [[Fossil Excavator]].

=== Other ===
{{NPCSprite|Odawa}} sells {{Item|Rough Amethyst Gemstone|amount=1}} for {{Item|Sludge Juice|amount=1}}.

Throwing the {{Item|Eternal Flame Ring}} into the correct lava pool yields {{Item|Rough Topaz Gemstone|amount=64}}.

== Usage ==
=== Gemstone Slots ===
{{Main|Gemstone Slots}}
Certain items have [[Gemstone Slots]], where a corresponding gemstone can be applied. Some are already unlocked, and others require {{c}} and/or items to be unlocked. The '''Gemstone''' applied gives varying stat bonuses depending on its tier.

=== Crafting ===
{{Green|Flawed}}, {{Blue|Fine}}, and {{Purple|Flawless}} '''Gemstones''' can be crafted with {{Green|80}} of the previous tiers.
