== Trivia ==
* '''Gemstones''' are the only [[Collection]] items which have 5 tiers ({{white|Rough}}, {{green|Flawed}}, {{blue|Fine}}, {{purple|Flawless}} and {{orange|Perfect}}).
* The only way to instantly mine Gemstones is with any tool that can break them and [[Armadillo Pet]]'s {{AN|Tunneller}} ability.
* All '''Gemstones''' in the {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}} take {{Green|5}} minutes to regenerate.

